# Stingerquill Voxmancer's upkeep ability has an intervening "if this creature isn't prepared" (CR 603.4): it becomes prepared at
# turn 3's upkeep, Bot1 does not cast the copy, and at turn 5's upkeep it is prepared already, so nothing triggers and there
# is still exactly one copy of Vicious Verse in exile (a creature cannot become prepared twice, CR 722.3a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Stingerquill Voxmancer
Mountain
Mountain
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stingerquill Voxmancer.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile.Count = 1
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Exile = Vicious Verse
Exile.Count = 1
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Stingerquill Voxmancer.Prepared = true
